WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.025
Section 4.

00:00:01.975 --> 00:00:04.087
The Subsidy Machine.

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:13.775
The federal government operates an intricate web of subsidies, tax credits, and grant programs funneling hundreds of millions into news organizations.

00:00:13.775 --> 00:00:16.825
They are dependent on the government they cover.
